OL,3,CFirefighters to continue tackling
OL,4,Cindustrial units blaze into weekend
OL,6,FFirefighters will continue tackling a
OL,7,Flarge industrial unit blaze in Essex
OL,8,Finto the weekend after a major
OL,9,Fincident was declared and residents
OL,10,Fwere evacuated.
OL,12,FFire crews were called to the blaze on
OL,13,FSouthend Road, between East
OL,14,FHanningfield and Rettendon, at 4.50pm
OL,15,Fon Friday, according to Essex County
OL,16,FFire and Rescue Service's website.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
