OL,3,CFirefighters to continue tackling
OL,4,Cindustrial units blaze into weekend
OL,6,FA number of industrial units and a
OL,7,Ffield caught alight, and while fire
OL,8,Fcrews were on scene fertiliser inside
OL,9,Fone of the units exploded ` which
OL,10,Fpeople across the county reported
OL,11,Fhearing and seeing, area manager Dave
OL,12,FBond said.
OL,14,FNearby residents have been evacuated
OL,15,Fwhile the fire is being extinguished
OL,16,Fand everyone at the scene is safe, he
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,19,FAbout 100 firefighters worked to
OL,20,Ftackle the fire, and some are expected
OL,21,Fto be at the scene overnight.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
