OL,3,CFirefighters to continue tackling
OL,4,Cindustrial units blaze into weekend
OL,6,FMr Bond said in a video update at
OL,7,F10.45pm: "We're still at the scene of
OL,8,Fa significant fire in East
OL,9,FHanningfield.
OL,11,F"As you can see behind me, we're still
OL,12,Fdealing with significant spots of
OL,13,Ffire. However, we do have this
OL,14,Fincident under control and surrounded.
OL,26,@oD@JOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
