PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1784971095
OL,3,CFirefighters to continue tackling
OL,4,Cindustrial units blaze into weekend
OL,6,F"We're in the process of scaling back,
OL,7,Fbut we do still have 50 firefighters
OL,8,Fon scene. We're still working closely
OL,9,Fwith our partners, including police,
OL,10,Fambulance, utility companies, and we
OL,11,Falso have a number of specialist
OL,12,Fadvisers on scene, giving us support
OL,13,Fas we move through the night.
OL,15,F"The incident will be ongoing into the
OL,16,Fweekend, so please stay away from the
OL,17,Farea and allow us to continue
OL,18,Foperations. We apologise for any
OL,19,Finconvenience this caused, and we
OL,20,Fthank you for your patience.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
