OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1784971095
OL,3,CFirefighters to continue tackling
OL,4,Cindustrial units blaze into weekend
OL,6,F"The advice we're still giving to the
OL,7,Fpublic is that if you do smell smoke,
OL,8,Fthen close your doors and windows. But
OL,9,Fplease bear with us as we continue our
OL,10,Foperations to extinguish the fire."
OL,12,FA spokesman for East of England
OL,13,FAmbulance Service said it had declared
OL,14,Fa critical incident and its hazardous
OL,15,Farea response team was in attendance.
OL,17,FSmoke plumes could be seen billowing
OL,18,Fin the sky in photos and videos posted
OL,19,Fonline, while some locals have said
OL,20,Fthey heard explosions.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@cO]
